<title>USA: USFreightways chosen by Wal-Mart.</title>
<headline>USFreightways chosen by Wal-Mart.</headline>
<dateline>ROSEMONT, Ill. 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>USFreightways Corp said Monday that four of its regional carriers have been chosen by Wal-Mart Stores Inc to be the company's primary carriers in their respective regions.</p>
<p>The carriers are based in Phoenix, Arizona; Wichita, Kansas; Portland, Oregon; and Newark, New Jersey.</p>
<p>Together, the four companies will form a distribution network for the nation's largest retailer, USFreightways said.</p>
<p>USFreightways shares closed up 5/8 at 24-3/4 Monday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
